{
  "kanji": "調",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 調\ntitle: investigate; tune\njlpt: 3\ntags: [jlpt-n3, grade-3, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 15\nradical: 言\nradicalNumber: 149\nonyomi: [チョウ]\nkunyomi: [しら.べる, しら.べ, ととの.う, ととの.える]\ndistractors: [週, 語, 訪]\n---\n\n# 調 — investigate; tune\n\n**Strokes:** 15 · **Key (radical):** 言 (no. 149) · **JLPT:** N3 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n調 has an investigation side in [調べる](../words/調べる.md) しらべる and a tone or condition side\nin 調子 ちょうし. Learn the reading with the word: looking up a fact is not the same action\nas tuning an instrument, even though the character connects this vocabulary.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic:** 言 beside the enclosing 周 shape can suggest asking carefully\nabout what is inside an area. This is an invented memory scene, not a historical explanation.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| しら.べる | kun | [調べる](../words/調べる.md) しらべる — investigate; look up |\n| チョウ | on | 調子 ちょうし — tone; condition |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [調べる](../words/調べる.md) しらべる — examine; check; look up\n- 調子 ちょうし — tone; condition; state of health\n\n## Notes\n\n調子がいい (ちょうしがいい) can mean \"in good condition\"; the subject determines\nwhether you are discussing a person or something else.\n[週](週.md) also contains 周 but has the movement-shaped outer part.\n[語](語.md) and [訪](訪.md) instead share 言.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project).\n\nVocabulary: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1429060, 1429170.\n",
